  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8e70547d8134d5943ac3fafcae79c9dc, type: 3}
  m_Name: LadyClorinde
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EventData
  title: Woman with a gemmed necklace
  description: 'As you are about to pay for your stay in the inn, a mysterious person
    catches your attention. Hooded woman with a necklace made of rubies. Her gaze
    pierces your eyes, making it hard to keep eye contact. You decide to ignore it,
    after all the journey here was too tiring, you could only think of getting in
    a soft bed after all these days of sleeping on the hard wooden floor. The woman
    gets up and crosses path with Zavren, her soft voice whispers something to him.
    Zavren''s surprised reaction made everyone else vary of the hooded woman. She
    calmly went outside the inn and gave a gesture to follow her. '
  image: {fileID: 0}
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
  choices:
  - choiceText: Continue
    outcomeText: 'You followed her reluctantly, where she revealed her face to you.
      It was a white haired woman with red eyes, glowing like the ruby she had. This
      woman wasn''t someone Zavren recognized, but the uniform she wore, the symbol
      on it. He could never forget it. She was a part of the Mage hunters. She drew
      her sword and musket and with lightning reflexes beat the party to the ground.
      Her speed, technique and power were unmatched. '
    goldChange: 0
    hpChangePercent: 0
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
